 & ≈\\frac{f(2)-f(2-4)}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{f(2)-f(-2)}{4} \\\\  & =\\frac{5-1}{4} \\\\  & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-47552/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6b175cb1-6615-540f-9145-224a838e37d0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-47552"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-343816/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "bf9cf71c-9be8-5841-8514-5c46185ff838" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-343816/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "29197f99-98d5-5393-abcb-5094b0a3fefa" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-343816/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-343816/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-343816" :question/id #uuid "aedcaddd-0808-5967-84ab-caaf86d93147" :question/math-academy-id "q-343816" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14058551/assets/2c633342d5dc1ddb1244d492d81b6b9c00ffe33858398a72acb2a73467d93bb0.png)\n\nThe graph of the function $g(x)$ is shown above. \nFind the approximate ${g}^{′}(x)$ at the point $x=4$ using a backward difference approximation with step size $h=2.$ Do not round the answer.\n\n*Hint: Assume that the graph passes through the points with integer $y$-coordinates when $x=2$ and $x=4.$*\n\n${g}^{′}(4)≈$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "We use the backward difference approximation formula\n\n$$\n{g}^{′}(x)≈\\frac{g(x)-g(x-h)}{h},\n$$\n\n \nat the point $x=4.$ Applying the above formula with $x=4$ and $h=2$ gives \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(4) & ≈\\frac{g(4)-g(4-2)}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{g(4)-g(2)}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{5-1}{2} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-343816/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6b175cb1-6615-540f-9145-224a838e37d0"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-343816"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-72074/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "ccb7aa40-937f-5f17-8d4f-fb68e5c4cf71" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72074/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "4c30de69-4592-553c-a70a-999ef262b75a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72074/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "382eb46f-d9f9-5a72-a728-4c356bdd4802" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72074/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "6b3a3dba-83f7-5aab-9d33-cb1bfa2f4602" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72074/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "0e5b7d39-867b-5456-bc82-2ef2915ad225" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-72074/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "a7995560-f7fe-5f57-bdb5-4b845a4b1015" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-72074/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer-field/choices ["q-72074/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-72074/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-72074/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d